OL,3,GNEWSA'I worked on 1970s dig that
OL,4,Achanged what we knew about Vikings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty years ago, Coppergate shopping
OL,7,Fcentre in York looked very different.
OL,9,FThe city centre site was the location
OL,10,Fof one of the most important digs in
OL,11,FBritish archaeological history, as
OL,12,Fexperts and volunteers recovered
OL,13,Fartefacts that would change our
OL,14,Funderstanding of Viking society.
OL,16,FThe 40,000 objects - among them shoes,
OL,17,Fknives, socks, coins and animal bones -
OL,18,Fwere the largest collection from the
OL,19,FViking era ever found in the country,
OL,20,Fand the Jorvik Viking Centre attraction
OL,21,Fwas later built to display many of
OL,22,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
