OL,3,GNEWSA'I worked on 1970s dig that
OL,4,Achanged what we knew about Vikings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge crowds lined viewing points to
OL,7,Fwatch the archaeologists at work, and
OL,8,Ffor Dr Julian D Richards, then 20,
OL,9,Fvolunteering in 1977 inspired his
OL,10,Fcareer.
